msgstr "Датчик дождя по умолчанию."

#: ospy/options.py:504
msgid "Set rain delay"
msgstr "Установить задержку дождя"

#: ospy/options.py:506
msgid ""
"When the rain sensor is activated, the rain delay is set (this is suitable, for "
